# Auto detect text files, and check them out with LF everywhere. Without the
# explicit eol, Windows clones get CRLF working copies and gofmt rejects every
# Go file in the repo while CI stays green -- the local formatting check becomes
# permanently red and stops carrying any signal.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, committed on purpose, and not worth reading in a diff.
# web/public/replay is recorded by cmd/record (see .github/workflows/record.yml)
# and routeTree.gen.ts is written by the TanStack Router Vite plugin.
web/public/replay/*.json linguist-generated -diff
web/src/routeTree.gen.ts linguist-generated -diff
package-lock.json linguist-generated -diff
